<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 4TH DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 4TH DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day of</p>
<p>the second cricket test between New Zealand and England on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 124</p>
<p>England first innings 383</p>
<p>New Zealand second innings (overnight 48 for no wicket)</p>
<p> B.Pocock not out			  45</p>
<p> B.Young c Stewart b Tufnell	   56</p>
<p> A.Parore lbw b Croft		    15 </p>
<p> S.Fleming c and b Croft		  0</p>
<p> D.Patel lbw b Croft			0</p>
<p> L.Germon not out			   0</p>
<p> Extras (nb-4, lb-4, b-1)		 9</p>
<p> Total for four wickets		 125</p>
<p>Fall: 1-89 2-125 3-125 4-125</p>
<p>Yet to bat: N.Astle, C.Cairns, S.Doull, G.Allott, D.Vettori</p>
<p>Bowling to date: Cork 8-1-34-0 (1nb), Caddick 16-7-25-0,</p>
<p>Croft 16-8-12-3 (nb-1), Gough 14-7-31-0, Tufnell 19-8-18-1</p>
<p>(nb-2).</p>
</text>
